{
  "name": "App promo",
  "description": "For a phone app only: a vertical promo with the app on a phone. A hook over footage, the app's name over its own screen recording, three of its screens (today's plan, a question answered, a helper citing its source), a bigger session, the two goals to reach, the result, the list of what the app covers, and the end card. Five footage slots; one takes the app's own recording. 38 s, also cut to 15 s (the hook, today's plan, the end card) and 30 s (without the list). Pick it only for a brief about an app; for any other business, pick a photo card or the Data story. Its music is \"Spring of 2026\" by Sascha Ende (CC BY 4.0) from 47.9 s; the post's copy carries its credit.",
